      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "怎么可能……我在后街租了一个小房间。\n观光景点的居民，过的都是这种生活。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4e6784d242d2b2d4d7ce03d0d25660d7d7873d9598292c69b0ba05cf245a401",
