    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55e5d69d0a6a7bce86865eca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们即使有梦想也无法实现，所以才希望你这种有机会\n实现梦想的小妹妹，能连同我们的份一起努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95379c0acbab19a13cc729f6cc7c9ed66a40cde9a049889c988940cbcdc289d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
