    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9bc668acec0ed354d2cb82b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "世界非常广大，大到连鼓励的话语都难以顺利传达。\n不过，唯有一样东西能跨越语言限制传达给所有人。那就是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "da035898cab54496026db353a1f222b8eb2a3e15d43342b55aac6f42806ad66c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1042/storytimeline_041042004.json",
      "json_path": [
