      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:516d84c1d4d10dcfbe8e8c36",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我终于明白采珠在追求什么样的光辉了。\n她追求的并非个人的胜利──",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfa252fba5aac6e7312110bacbc47294eeec7e6f26dc1a2a32f74efca66e11a0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1042/storytimeline_041042004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:681588030330750bc7391bbe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而是带给全世界的人们希望。她口中的世界级，\n并不是指才能──而是在胜利之后所追求的目标规模。",
      "source_fingerprint": "915757607a8c906f0217d291fa4a29ef0d09ad3ad243cfb589cd8b2c42caea4f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1042/storytimeline_041042004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1296cebccda41c0f2d8378f9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "采珠",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0589b9ffcd8d20fe1764810bd01425a20cb1331d718258942cea39c70163e02",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
