      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想要先假设各种可能性并一一尝试。\n这是为了让自己无论何时都不会失去希望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a736058f23e3447e5d01d4fbddeed62093110412f9fc135aab404f1d7eda2a73",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
